  "summary": "Malicious code in @united-airlines-org/atmos-design-system (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook runs curl against the attacker-controlled host bxss[.]boll-sec[.]de, appending the machine's hostname base64-encoded as a URL path segment (hostname_\u003cbase64\u003e). On every install it exfiltrates the hostname of the installing machine to this remote host. The package ships no code, README, or license — only the malicious install hook.",
